In this library the files necessary to reproduce the fitting in the manuscript are provided.

FOTO_MODEL_bimolecular-CE-reduced.cps: COPASI file used for fitting

DAbs1.txt, DAbs2.txt, DAbs3.txt, DAbs4.txt: experimental curves obtained from https://doi.org/10.1016/j.xpro.2023.102312 by WebPlotDigitizer ((https://automeris.io).

QDabs1.txt, QDabs2.txt, QDabs3.txt, QDabs4.txt, QDabs5.txt: experimental curves obtained from https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.4c08158 by WebPlotDigitizer

PL1.txt, PL2.txt, PL3.txt, PL4.txt, PL5.txt, PL6.txt: experimental data obtained from https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.4c08158 for the Stern-Vollmer plot


